---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Credits — Edward Jakunskas" description="Third-party fonts, code and assets used on this site, with their licences." path="/credits/">
  <h1>Credits</h1>
  <p>Everything on this site that is not mine, with its licence. The full map of what is licensed how is in the repository's <code>NOTICE.md</code>.</p>
  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Bricolage Grotesque</strong> (headings and interface), SIL Open Font License 1.1, via Fontsource. <a href="/credits/bricolage-grotesque-OFL.txt">Licence text</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Source Serif 4</strong> (body text), SIL Open Font License 1.1, via Fontsource. <a href="/credits/source-serif-4-OFL.txt">Licence text</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Code</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Astro</strong> and its integrations, MIT.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="sans" style="color: var(--muted);">Rows are added in the step that introduces each item: three.js and three-mesh-bvh with the scan game, the Kenney Tiny Town and Tiny Creatures tiles with the courtyard, Wikimedia Commons photographs with the gallery page.</p>
</BaseLayout>
